      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical alloying and spark plasma sintering can produce oxide precipitates in a refractory high-entropy alloy.",
